us schedule. This prevention avoids the mixed structure. [Data: Entities (453, 468); Relationships (796, 842)]\"},{\"summary\":\"γ–α interactions and interfacial area control refinement and toughness\",\"explanation\":\"α-grains nucleate at γ-grain boundaries and in deformation bands. The effective γ interfacial area S_v equals grain-boundary area plus deformation bands, and grain-boundary area increases by a factor of about 2 when total deformation in the non-recrystallization region is 70–80%. Deformation of γ in the non-recrystallization region produces deformed γ, and deformed γ transformation gives a fine α-grain structure. α-grain dimensional anisotropy is relevant to transgranular fracture. [Data: Entities (556, 540, 362, 108, 130, 465); Relationships (976, 992, 196, 138, 1467, 1003)]\"}]}"}, "metrics": {"attempted_request_count": 1, "successful_response_count": 0, "failed_response_count": 0, "responses_with_tokens": 1, "prompt_tokens": 6589, "completion_tokens": 5881, "total_tokens": 12470, "compute_duration_seconds": 27.806172132492065, "streaming_responses": 0, "retries": 0, "requests_with_retries": 0}}}